          "text": "nihewulu dachisu chaEfweremi, nikuchisu chachikulu, nikuchisu chanshi, nikukaposhi kaHananeli, nikukaposhi kaHameya, ndo nikuchisu chanyikoku; emana nimuchisu chaawatulama. ",
