          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naMayaseya, naShemaya, naEleyazari, naUzi, naYehohanani, naMalikiya, naElami, naEzeri. Akwakwimba tumina hiyakwimba chakola, hamu namukwakuyitala Yezerahiya. ",
