        },
        {
          "text": "Denodu ifuku hiyakuketula yimuna yayivulu nankashi; hiyakuzaŋalala, muloŋa Nzambi wayizaŋalesheli namuzapalu waweni; azapaleli niambanda nianyananawa; muzaŋalu waYerusalema wutiyakana nikwakulehi.",
