        {
          "text": "Hefuku denodu akunjikili amayala kumudimu wakutalaŋa matala akuswekela niyuma yalema, ninyilambu yakuleleka, niyakudya yatachi, niyuma yamwikumi, kulonda apompeshelumu maseka akunjikililuwu atupristuna waLevi kunshimbi, mwomwekalila maha akunyikala; muŋa aYuda azapaleli hansaŋu yawatupristu nawaLevi emenuku, ",
