        {
          "text": "adiŋi nakwila mudimu waNzambi yawu, nimudimu wakutookeshapa, mwomwelilaŋawuni akwakwimba niakwakuhemba kuyisu nawa, mwomwayilejeliyi Davidi namwanindi Solomoni. ",
