        {
          "text": "Muloŋa hashankulu hamafuku adiŋi Davidi naAsafwi, kwadiŋi mukulumpi wawakwakwimba tumina, amwimbililaŋa Nzambi tumina twakumushimeka nakumusakilila. ",
