        {
          "text": "Hamafuku adiŋiyi Zerubabeli, nihamafuku adiŋiyi Nehemiya, aIsarela ejima ahenaŋa maseka awakwakwimba nawakwakuhemba kuyisu, ifuku namasekadu, ifuku namasekadu, aambwilaŋaku aLevi yuma yawu yayijilikililuwu; aLevini wena aambwililaŋaku anyana kaAroni yuma yawu yayijilikililuwu.",
